; The Adreno driver owns the display on SDM845, the root enumerated basic display adapter stays
; off so dxgkrnl cannot pair it with the panel. dxgkrnl waits for BasicRender at session create,
; so that one stays. The XDDM framebuffer remains the fallback.

[AddReg]
HKLM,"SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\BasicDisplay","Start",0x00010001,0x00000004
